-----------------------------------------------------------------------------



                          Node icon functions
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

SYSOPLOGIN              :  NodeLogin as sysop.
                           If you login using this icon, you will skip
                           the welcome message and name/password prompt.
                           Loginbatch execution is also skipped.

LOCALLOGIN              :  Nodelogin.
                           This icon will activate a local login on the
                           system and proceeding with a login sequence
                           just as if system received a call from a
                           remote user.

INS.LOGIN               :  Instant login.
                           Give a carrier signal to remote user.
                           Sends ANSWERSTRING to modem.

RESERVE NODE            :  Reserve node for user.
                           This will activate reservation of node.
                           Node will not accept calls from other users
                           except newusers, and newusers will be disconnected
                           after they are accepted on the system.
                           Node is once again ready to receive calls from
                           other users, when the user this node is reserved
                           for is logged off.

CLOSEDOWN               :  Closedown active node.
                           Sends a message to online user, telling him to
                           end his action within 1 minute as node will be
                           shutdown.

DROP DTR                :  Disconnect current user from the node.
                           Will disconnect a user online, or hangup a
                           call currently in init state (carrier detect).

OPEN SHELL              :  Open shell   (currently unavailable)

DIRECT UL               :  Send file(s) to user online.
                           Protocol used will be users default transfer
                           protocol.

CAP ON/OFF              :  Open/Close capture
                           Start a capture of data received from input
                           and sent to screen.

TOGGLE CHAT             :  Toggle chat.
                           Enable/Disable paging of sysop.

EDITUSER                :  User account edit
                           If a user is online a seperate task will be
                           started and you can edit users data.
                           If user data changes , window will be updated.
                           If node is offline, user account editor will
                           be started on the node screen.

EXITNODE                :  Close node
                           At all times you can exit a node and put
                           it offline.

